Default apply path is the Management API. Project ref: `mjuannepfodstbsxweuc`.

1. Hand-name the file `supabase/migrations/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_<name>.sql` (unique 14-digit version). Qualify tables as `disciplan.` and include GRANT + RLS.
2. PAT (never echo): `security find-generic-password -s "Supabase CLI" -w | sed 's/^go-keyring-base64://' | base64 -d`
